        <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">certificates, executed on behalf of the Company, dated as of the Initial Closing Date, certifying the resolutions adopted by the boards of directors of the Company
            approving the transactions contemplated by this Agreement and the other Transaction Documents, as applicable, certifying the current versions of the constitutional documents of the Company and certifying as to the signatures and authority of
            Persons signing this Agreement and the other Transaction Documents, as applicable, and related documents on behalf of the Company; and</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
