        <td style="width: 45pt; vertical-align: top; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">(viii)</td>
        <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
          <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">a certificate, executed on behalf of the Company by its Chief Executive Officer or its Chief Financial Officer, dated as of the Initial Closing Date, certifying to the
            fulfillment of the conditions specified in Section 2.4(b).</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
