          <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">immediately available funds, via wire transfer, equal to such Purchaser&#8217;s Subscription Amount with respect to the Initial Note and the Initial Warrants as set forth on
            the signature page hereto executed by such Purchaser;</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
